OL,3,GNEWSASomerset in 'most challenging'
OL,4,Aplaces to be a child
OL,5,
OL,6,FLow spend on youth services,
OL,7,Finstability for children in care and
OL,8,Fmissing deadlines to deliver care plans
OL,9,Ffor young people with additional needs
OL,10,Fhave been identified as barriers to
OL,11,Fgrowing up in Somerset.
OL,13,FChildren's Commissioner Dame Rachel de
OL,14,FSouza's latest report into childhood
OL,15,Foutcomes has placed Somerset as the
OL,16,F11th "most challenging" place to grow
OL,17,Fup in England.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1792653951
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASomerset in 'most challenging'
OL,4,Aplaces to be a child
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite being among the lowest
OL,7,Fperforming authorities, its lack of
OL,8,Fyoung people not in education,
OL,9,Femployment or training (NEETs) and high
OL,10,Fuptake of apprenticeships were
OL,11,Frecognised.
OL,13,FPaul Matcham, a youth worker at
OL,14,FMinehead Eye and the Somerset Youth
OL,15,FAlliance, said the "isolation of young
OL,16,Fpeople is a real challenge".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
